MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

July 14, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-40-21 for a Contract between the City of Cheyenne and
Goat Green, LLC, for providing Vegetation Management for Dry Creek and Crow
Creek, for the City of Cheyenne Engineering Department
______________________________________________
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The One (1) Bid was received from:
1. Goat Green, LLC, Wellington, CO.

The bid was reviewed by Tom Cobb (Engineering), and Sam Berta (Engineering).  Their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Goat Green, LLC, for providing
Vegetation Management for Dry Creek and Crow Creek, for the City of Cheyenne Engineering
Department, for a bid award amount of $69,776.00.

Funding:
020-26-2618-42-43601 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Drainage)

$69,776.00
```

